💰 7) نظام Premium
Pseudo
WHEN user clicks premium content:

IF user.premium == true:
    ALLOW download
ELSE:
    SHOW payment page
📥 8) نظام التحميلات
Pseudo
FOR each file in downloads:

IF file.type == "free":
    SHOW download button

IF file.type == "premium":
    IF user.premium == true:
        SHOW download button
    ELSE:
        LOCK content
